# The PrismPM revision `prismpm build` is made by in .github/workflows/lexlean.yml,
# the only place it is written (AGENTS.md R1), like .github/lexlean.rev. The
# workflow builds `prismpm` at this commit (`cargo install --git ... --rev ... --locked`
# from the PrismPM workspace's binary crate) and builds the conformance server
# application with it (conformance/, prismpm.toml).
#
# The pin moves to the PrismPM SDK release before MCP v0.1.0.
#
# Currently: the branch claude/lexlean-mcp-conformance-compiler of
# UOR-Foundation/PrismPM at 898af195, which is PrismPM#339 at its head f5927bf46b92
# (the `ServerApplication` model, the server build and the host packages) with one
# change: vendor/lexlean is release/v0.4 at 9796067 instead of cee0fbade. The
# vendored cee0fbade cannot read this repository's sources (LLP2001 on `term_cases`,
# src/Json.lex.tex:230); 9796067 reads them, and lexlean.conformance.lock is made by
# it. Move this line to #339's head, or to the SDK release, once its vendored LexLean
# reads these sources.
rev = 898af195bc611aff8e1c5ea37503ec39bc2d1f37
